              </?01M0R723SQB4EN816R4400SHEH>
              <Criterion #P4-T2-AC2 { checked = true } ?01M0R723SQB4EN816R4400SHEJ>
              A fresh registry consumer exercises claim expiry/recovery, terminal settlement, BP mapping and file-owner restart from the released closure.
              </?01M0R723SQB4EN816R4400SHEJ>
            ]>
          )>
        ]>
      )>
    ]>
